1
00:00:00,449 --> 00:00:03,249
(Penny:)Uh, well, you know
your private bathroom?

2
00:00:03,252 --> 00:00:05,482
(Dan:)Yeah?
That was supposed to
be for the whole floor.

3
00:00:05,487 --> 00:00:07,787
(Bernadette:)You're kidding.
DAN:
No, no.

4
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:10,390
(Dan:)It's okay. It only really
affected Wheelchair Kathy,

5
00:00:10,392 --> 00:00:12,492
(Dan:)and she's back
in the hospital now,

6
00:00:12,494 --> 00:00:14,564
(Dan:)so it all worked out.

7
00:00:14,563 --> 00:00:17,763
(Bernadette:)I feel so bad.
Yeah.

8
00:00:17,766 --> 00:00:19,166
(Penny:)Well, then, maybe

9
00:00:19,168 --> 00:00:20,798
(Penny:)you shouldn't have named her
"Wheelchair Kathy."

10
00:00:22,438 --> 00:00:23,968
Oh, my God!

11
00:00:23,973 --> 00:00:27,403
(Bernadette:)I thought everybody liked me,
but I'm just a monster.

12
00:00:27,409 --> 00:00:31,349
(Dan:)But a cute one, like that, uh,
eyeball guy in Monsters, Inc.

13
00:00:31,347 --> 00:00:33,947
(Bernadette:)No, I'm the worst.

14
00:00:33,949 --> 00:00:35,519
(Bernadette:)I'm a terrible person.

15
00:00:35,517 --> 00:00:38,187
(Dan:)Come on, don't cry.
It's okay.

16
00:00:38,187 --> 00:00:39,487
(crying):
It's not okay.

17
00:00:39,488 --> 00:00:42,018
(Bernadette:)How can I even work here
anymore?
Oh.

18
00:00:42,024 --> 00:00:43,594
(Penny:)Because this company needs you.
DAN:
It's fine.

19
00:00:43,592 --> 00:00:45,422
(Dan:)We don't mind paying
for the coffee.

20
00:00:45,427 --> 00:00:47,657
(Bernadette:)I can't let you do that.

21
00:00:47,663 --> 00:00:49,493
(Dan:)Maybe we could get you

22
00:00:49,498 --> 00:00:51,598
(Dan:)an espresso machine
for your office.

23
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,530
(crying):
I guess that would be all right.

24
00:00:53,535 --> 00:00:55,635
(Penny:)All right.

25
00:00:55,637 --> 00:00:58,167
(crying)
See? You don't have

26
00:00:58,173 --> 00:00:59,643
(Penny:)to be mean
to get what you want.

